      "side": 1,
      "message": "This declares the variable `bta_jv` *and* initializes it to what we want (`evt_data`) at the same time and has the added benefit of compiler checks for missing initialized fields.\n\nThe previous incantation declares `bta_jv` and then defines it `bta_jv.rfc_cl_init` in two stages.  The declaration may or may not set default values within a more complex data type (versus primitives such as ints) and the compiler will not warn about a mix of default and subsequent initialized values completely validate the structure.\n\nA later CL should move this up to the top and eliminate this additional data.\n\ne.g.\n(look up top)",
